<idea-plugin>
    <!--
        Loaded only when org.jetbrains.junie (Junie) is installed - see the
        optional <depends> in plugin.xml. Empty today.

        Validated 2026.2 (build 262): Junie does NOT auto-inherit our MCP tools.
        Like any external MCP client, Junie must be pointed at the IDE's built-in
        MCP server via Settings | Tools | MCP Server | Clients Auto-Configuration
        (Auto-Configure Junie). Our tools also default to "router-only", so they
        are reached through the universal execute_tool router, not listed by name.
        Skills are discovered separately via the .junie/skills/ convention.

        Reserved for future Junie-specific wiring (e.g. auto-registering the
        client, or forcing tools non-router-only) if a direct integration point
        becomes available - see CONTRIBUTING.md "Known open risk".
    -->
</idea-plugin>
